  "_comment": "Model ids verified 2026-11-26 against the official model pages (see ARGE brief B3.2). Prices are USD per 1M tokens, null = price not entered yet. price_cache_read and price_cache_write price prompt tokens served from or written to the provider's prompt cache (Anthropic needs the cache marker the adapter sends, DeepSeek caches on its own, Gemini 4 cachedContentTokenCount feeds cache_read_tokens), a missing value means price_in. DeepSeek prices are the off-peak rates. Gemini 4 prices are the paid tier of the AI Studio pricing page checked on 2026-11-27, gemini-4-carbon at the rate that starts on 2026-12-01 (2.00 and 10.00 before). API keys are never stored here, only the environment variable names. deepseek.thinking maps a role (pass1, pass2, roundtrip, literal, pick, recheck, pairwise, J1, J2, J3) or 'default' to true / false, a missing entry keeps the API default. anthropic.effort and google.effort map roles to low, medium or high thinking effort. max_output_tokens is the model's output maximum (Claude 5.5 128000, DeepSeek 393216, Gemini 4 foreground 65536). batch holds the batch API settings that --batch uses (Anthropic Message Batches and Gemini Batch Mode, DeepSeek has none).",
